From 1280f8312d0b9ee6390c906526e495289fee90a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arbion Halili <99731180+ToxicPine@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:57:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] vm_memory: support private anonymous regions

Allow guest memory to mix descriptor-backed shared RAM with private anonymous
RAM. Omit private regions from vhost-user tables, validate KSM ranges, and
handle descriptor absence, discard, and snapshots explicitly.
---
